### cr102-real-nan-bit-patterns
# CR-102 regression blocks: pure refactoring, expected results recorded from the pre-CR-102 build.
# E5a NaN test is now a bit-pattern test (no isnan()).
# quiet, signalling, negative, all-ones NaN refused; +/-Inf, -0.0, max finite, denormal encoded.
